        {
          "Text": "Well, I'm pretty new here myself but I'll tell you what I know. This facility handles quite a bit of different research and development. The boys in the lab are working on some new weapon systems for the Republic, last I heard. I know there's being work done for a number of organizations down on Viscara.",
